# ==============================================================================
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/
[Tt]est-[Rr]esults/
[Cc]overage[Rr]eport*/
coverage-report*/
coverage-results/
temp-coverage/
temp-coverage-report/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.cobertura.xml
*.opencover.xml
coverage.*/
**/coverage.*
[Ss]tryker[Oo]utput/
**/StrykerOutput/
diag.log
stryker.log

# ==============================================================================
# Performance Benchmarks (BenchmarkDotNet)
# ==============================================================================
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
benchmarks/results/*.log
benchmarks/**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# ==============================================================================
